VALUES (4600093825030129, ARRAY['"[8 marks] Explain and apply Present Scenario of Crude Oil Refinery in “Basics of Petroleum and Refinery”; include the governing principle, an example and a verification or limitation."'::jsonb, '"[8 marks] Explain and apply Primary treatment of crude : Dehydration and Desalting of crude oil in “Properties of Crude and Petroleum Products”; include the governing principle, an example and a verification or limitation."'::jsonb, '"[8 marks] Explain and apply Various types of cracking: Thermal cracking in “Processing of Petroleum”; include the governing principle, an example and a verification or limitation."'::jsonb, '"[8 marks] Explain and apply Purpose and methods of sulphurremoval : Doctor''s sweetening in “Treatment Techniques”; include the governing principle, an example and a verification or limitation."'::jsonb]::jsonb[], ARRAY[]::jsonb[], ARRAY['"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning (2):** Crude oil is a complex mixture; composition and properties guide refining processes and yields.\n\n**Principles/steps (3):** Explain the concept and connect it to Importance, Occurrence, Origin (formation), Exploration.\n\n**Application/example (2):** Apply it to a realistic PERTOLEUM REFINING & PETROCHEMICALS task and state the expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1):** Check the result and mention a relevant limitation or risk.\n\nMarking guide: meaning 2; principles 3; application 2; verification 1."'::jsonb, '"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning (2):** Crude oil is a complex mixture; composition and properties guide refining processes and yields.\n\n**Principles/steps (3):** Explain the concept and connect it to Various refinery products, Distillation of crude : Atmospheric Distillation, Vacuum distillation of crude residue, Different physical properties of fraction of petroleum such as Flash& Fire Point.\n\n**Application/example (2):** Apply it to a realistic PERTOLEUM REFINING & PETROCHEMICALS task and state the expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1):** Check the result and mention a relevant limitation or risk.\n\nMarking guide: meaning 2; principles 3; application 2; verification 1."'::jsonb, '"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning (2):** Various types of cracking: Thermal cracking is covered in “Processing of Petroleum”. Define it, describe the main steps/components, relate it to catalytic cracking, Fluidised bed catalytic cracking and it’s dependency on temperature and pressure, Reforming: purpose and discrimination between thermal and catalytic reforming, Platforming (Pt catalyst- Reforming), give an example and mention a check or limitation.\n\n**Principles/steps (3):** Explain the concept and connect it to catalytic cracking, Fluidised bed catalytic cracking and it’s dependency on temperature and pressure, Reforming: purpose and discrimination between thermal and catalytic reforming, Platforming (Pt catalyst- Reforming).\n\n**Application/example (2):** Apply it to a realistic PERTOLEUM REFINING & PETROCHEMICALS task and state the expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1):** Check the result and mention a relevant limitation or risk.\n\nMarking guide: meaning 2; principles 3; application 2; verification 1."'::jsonb, '"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning (2):** Purpose and methods of sulphurremoval : Doctor''s sweetening is covered in “Treatment Techniques”. Define it, describe the main steps/components, relate it to Catalytic desulfurization, Various Methods of Treatment of Lubes such as Clay Treatment, Phenol Extraction, Furfural Extraction, give an example and mention a check or limitation.\n\n**Principles/steps (3):** Explain the concept and connect it to Catalytic desulfurization, Various Methods of Treatment of Lubes such as Clay Treatment, Phenol Extraction, Furfural Extraction.\n\n**Application/example (2):** Apply it to a realistic PERTOLEUM REFINING & PETROCHEMICALS task and state the expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1):** Check the result and mention a relevant limitation or risk.\n\nMarking guide: meaning 2; principles 3; application 2; verification 1."'::jsonb]::jsonb[]);

