VALUES (4600093825010129, ARRAY['"[8 marks] Explain and apply Tray Towers in “Equipments for Gas-Liquid Operations”; include the governing principle, an example and a verification or limitation."'::jsonb, '"[8 marks] Explain and apply Definition and Industrial application in “Adsorption”; include the governing principle, an example and a verification or limitation."'::jsonb, '"[8 marks] Explain and apply Importance of Humidification operation in Chemical Industry in “Humidification”; include the governing principle, an example and a verification or limitation."'::jsonb, '"[8 marks] Explain and apply Concept and application in “Crystallization”; include the governing principle, an example and a verification or limitation."'::jsonb]::jsonb[], ARRAY[]::jsonb[], ARRAY['"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning (2):** Tray Towers is covered in “Equipments for Gas-Liquid Operations”. Define it, describe the main steps/components, relate it to Different types of Trays, weirs, criteria for selection of trays, Flooding, give an example and mention a check or limitation.\n\n**Principles/steps (3):** Explain the concept and connect it to Different types of Trays, weirs, criteria for selection of trays, Flooding.\n\n**Application/example (2):** Apply it to a realistic UNIT OPERATION - IV task and state the expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1):** Check the result and mention a relevant limitation or risk.\n\nMarking guide: meaning 2; principles 3; application 2; verification 1."'::jsonb, '"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning (2):** Definition and Industrial application is covered in “Adsorption”. Define it, describe the main steps/components, relate it to Types of Adsorption, various equipments for adsorption, commonly used Adsorbents in Chemical Industries, Effect of Temperature on Adsorption, give an example and mention a check or limitation.\n\n**Principles/steps (3):** Explain the concept and connect it to Types of Adsorption, various equipments for adsorption, commo